# =============================================================================
# ai-service build context exclusions.
#
# Build context is this directory: `docker build -t ai-service:local ai-service`.
# The repo-root /.dockerignore does NOT apply here — it only covers builds that
# pass `.` as the context. Both files are required; see
# docs/docker-standards.md § .dockerignore.
#
# Patterns are matched relative to the context root, NOT recursively. A bare
# `*.key` excludes ./foo.key and nothing else. Secret patterns therefore carry
# a `**/` prefix or they are decorative.
# =============================================================================

# --- VCS ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.git/
.gitignore

# --- Node build output and deps ----------------------------------------------
# node_modules is rebuilt inside the image from package-lock.json; copying the
# host's would defeat the npm ci cache layer and may carry host-OS binaries.
node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
.tmp/
npm-debug.log*

# --- Tests -------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tests run in CI (.github/workflows/ci.yml), not in the image build.
# Excluding them keeps test-only commits from invalidating the source layer.
test/
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.e2e-spec.ts

# --- Lambda event fixtures ---------------------------------------------------
# Test inputs piped in at invoke time, not image content.
events/

# --- Local config and secrets (must never enter an image layer) --------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.jks
**/*credentials*.json
**/*service-account*.json

# --- Docs and tooling config -------------------------------------------------
*.md
.prettierrc
eslint.config.mjs
Dockerfile
.dockerignore

# --- IDE / editor ------------------------------------------------------------
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.swp
*~

# --- OS noise ----------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
